---
import PageHead from '../components/PageHead.astro';
import PortfolioHeader from '../components/PortfolioHeader.astro';
import PortfolioFooter from '../components/PortfolioFooter.astro';
import '@fontsource-variable/inter';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><PageHead title="About — Deanna Glaze" description="How Deanna Glaze approaches complex systems, design leadership, and the people at the center of the work." />
<body><a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a><div class="page">
<PortfolioHeader active="about" />
<main id="main"><section class="biography"><div class="portrait"><img src="/images/about/workshop.jpg" alt="Deanna at a research workshop"/></div><div class="bio-copy"><h1>How I think</h1><div class="bio-text"><p><strong>I like understanding complicated systems made up of people.</strong> I've worked at places like Amazon, Virgin Pulse, and early-stage startups in both manager and IC roles. I've learned that titles describe where I happened to sit, not how I think.</p><p>The most interesting challenges rarely fit into neat boxes or standard career tracks. I'm drawn to messy problems where my impact might mean mapping a UX strategy, defining an AI interaction model, or building operations for a growing design team. It's this adaptable path that makes me an effective design leader.</p><p>Outside of product work, I founded <a href="https://aerialbooks.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Aerial Books</a> because reading and writing are another way for me to understand people. That curiosity shapes not only how I write, but how I approach every problem worth solving.</p></div></div></section><div class="monkey-section"><aside class="monkey"><img src="/images/exploration/monkeyshine-wayfarer.png" width="1280" height="1280" alt="Monkeyshine, a curious monkey with black Wayfarer-style glasses and pink arms"/><div><h2>And the little monkey?</h2><p>My freelance business used to be called Monkeyshine—a nod to my sign in Eastern astrology. This little version of me carries that history forward, introducing you to the thinking behind my work.</p></div></aside></div></main><PortfolioFooter /></div>
<style is:global>
:root{--ink:#29282d;--muted:#66616b;--plum:#853b72;--line:#e4dfe4}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{padding-bottom:68px;margin:0;background:white;color:var(--ink);font:18px/29px 'Inter Variable',Arial,sans-serif}.page{max-width:1472px;padding:0 80px;margin:auto}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}a:hover{text-decoration:underline}a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--plum);outline-offset:5px}h1,h2,p{margin:0}header{height:88px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}.wordmark{font-size:19px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.6px}nav{display:flex;gap:36px;font-size:13px;line-height:normal;color:var(--muted)}nav .active{color:var(--plum);font-weight:600;border-bottom:2px solid var(--plum);padding-bottom:8px;margin-bottom:-10px}.biography{display:grid;grid-template-columns:400px minmax(0,1fr);gap:88px;padding:56px 0 64px}.portrait{position:relative;width:400px;height:500px;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden}.portrait img{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}.bio-copy h1{font:400 64px/64px Newsreader,Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-1.8px;margin-bottom:28px}.bio-text{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px;color:var(--muted)}strong{font-weight:600;color:var(--ink)}.bio-text a{color:var(--plum);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}.monkey-section{padding-bottom:40px}.monkey{display:flex;gap:22px;align-items:center;max-width:824px;margin-left:488px;padding-top:26px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.monkey img{width:106px;height:130px;object-fit:contain;flex-shrink:0}.monkey h2{font:400 27px/1.12 Newsreader,Georgia,serif;margin-bottom:8px}.monkey p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--muted)}footer{position:fixed;bottom:0;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);width:calc(100% - 160px);max-width:1312px;height:44px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;border-top:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;z-index:10;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;color:var(--muted)}footer a{display:flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px}footer a:last-child{color:var(--plum)}.skip{position:fixed;transform:translateY(-200%);background:white;padding:10px;z-index:20}.skip:focus{transform:none}
@media(max-width:1200px){.page{padding:0 40px}.biography{grid-template-columns:320px minmax(0,1fr);gap:48px}.portrait{width:320px;height:400px}.monkey{margin-left:368px}.bio-copy h1{font-size:56px}}
@media(max-width:900px){.biography{grid-template-columns:260px minmax(0,1fr);gap:32px}.portrait{width:260px;height:325px}.bio-text{font-size:16px;line-height:26px}.monkey{margin-left:292px}}
@media(max-width:700px){.page{padding:0 22px}header{height:76px}.wordmark{font-size:18px}nav{gap:20px}.biography{display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding:30px 0;gap:30px}.portrait{width:280px;height:350px}.bio-copy h1{font-size:44px;line-height:46px;margin-bottom:24px}.monkey{margin-left:0;gap:14px}.monkey img{width:80px;height:110px}.monkey h2{font-size:25px}}
@media(max-width:1200px){footer{width:calc(100% - 80px)}}
@media(max-width:760px){body{padding-bottom:0}footer{position:static;transform:none;width:100%;margin-top:24px;height:48px}}
</style></body></html>